field.doc:
The rotation angle of the scan region seen from the ``y`` axis. It is supposed to be
equal to :ref:`scan_angle_x </NXspm/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/SCAN_ENVIRONMENT/SPM_SCAN_CONTROL/scan_region/scan_angle_x-field>`;
:ref:`scan_angle_x </NXspm/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/SCAN_ENVIRONMENT/SPM_SCAN_CONTROL/scan_region/scan_angle_x-field>` alone is sufficient.
